      "raw_text": "Calling out what they described as “heartless” neglect, health workers from various public and private hospitals in the National Capital Region staged a “Black Hearts Day Protest” in Mendiola, Manila on Friday, Feb. 13, denouncing what they claimed was the government’s failure to protect their rights and ensure accessible, quality health care for the public.\n\nhttps://t.co/kEWJOs7qXu",
